---
// WhyCleanCard.astro - Red Threat & Privacy Breakdown
---

<section class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-8">
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-6">
    <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-white mb-2">
      Hidden Threat Breakdown
    </h3>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed">
      How smartphones automatically attach surveillance identifiers to every image file.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- 3 Threat Scenarios Grid -->
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-12">
    <!-- Threat 1: Physical Doxxing -->
    <div class="crimson-glass p-6 rounded-2xl border border-red-500/30 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-red-500/60 transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-red-600/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-950/80 border border-red-500/50 flex items-center justify-center text-red-400 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
        📍
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
        Home Address Doxxing
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-950 text-red-300 border border-red-600/50">Critical Risk</span>
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        You post a photo of your new pet or desk setup on Reddit. If the platform preserves original attachments, anyone can inspect <code class="text-red-400 bg-[#0c0507] px-1 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">GPSLatitude</code> to locate your front door within 3 meters.
      </p>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#0c0507] border border-red-950 text-[11px] font-mono text-gray-400">
        <span class="text-red-500 font-bold">LEAK:</span> 37°46'29.8"N 122°25'09.8"W<br />
        <span class="text-[#9CA3AF]">→ Exact Physical Street Address Exposed</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Threat 2: Cross-Platform Device Fingerprinting -->
    <div class="crimson-glass p-6 rounded-2xl border border-red-500/30 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-red-500/60 transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-red-600/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-950/80 border border-red-500/50 flex items-center justify-center text-red-400 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
        🔍
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
        Hardware Fingerprinting
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-950 text-red-300 border border-red-600/50">High Threat</span>
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Camera sensors and lenses embed unique factory serial numbers (<code class="text-red-400 bg-[#0c0507] px-1 py-0.5 rounded font-mono">BodySerialNumber</code>). OSINT scrapers correlate serials to link your anonymous Reddit throwaway to your personal LinkedIn or Quora.
      </p>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#0c0507] border border-red-950 text-[11px] font-mono text-gray-400">
        <span class="text-red-500 font-bold">SERIAL:</span> #DN6L4980P0K5<br />
        <span class="text-[#9CA3AF]">→ Identity Correlated Across Social Sites</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Threat 3: Timeline & Routine Tracking -->
    <div class="crimson-glass p-6 rounded-2xl border border-red-500/30 relative overflow-hidden group hover:border-red-500/60 transition-all duration-300">
      <div class="absolute -top-10 -right-10 w-32 h-32 bg-red-600/10 rounded-full blur-2xl pointer-events-none"></div>
      <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-red-950/80 border border-red-500/50 flex items-center justify-center text-red-400 text-2xl mb-4 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">
        ⏱️
      </div>
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2 flex items-center justify-between">
        Sub-Second Time Leaks
        <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-950 text-red-300 border border-red-600/50">Habit Exposure</span>
      </h3>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed mb-4">
        Photos record the exact millisecond, timezone offset, and software build. Malicious actors analyze timestamps to determine when you leave home for work or travel out of town on vacation.
      </p>
      <div class="p-3 rounded-lg bg-[#0c0507] border border-red-950 text-[11px] font-mono text-gray-400">
        <span class="text-red-500 font-bold">TIMESTAMP:</span> 2026-10-14 15:32:18.42<br />
        <span class="text-[#9CA3AF]">→ Routine & Work Hours Revealed</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Terminal Comparison (Raw Leaks vs Red Vault Sanitized) -->
  <div class="crimson-glass rounded-2xl p-5 sm:p-8 border border-red-500/30">
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-6">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-extrabold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>Memory Buffer Payload Comparison</span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-red-950 text-red-300 border border-red-500/40">Verified</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-[#9CA3AF]">What social platforms extract from an untouched photo vs after CleanPhoto scrubbing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="text-xs font-mono text-red-400 bg-[#0c0507] px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg border border-red-950 self-start sm:self-auto">
        Zero Cloud API Calls
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
      <!-- Raw Image Leaks -->
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#030102] p-4 border border-red-500/40 relative">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-red-400 pb-2 mb-2 border-b border-red-950">
          <span class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500 animate-pulse"></span>
            Raw Smartphone Photo (52 Leaks)
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] bg-red-950 text-red-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-red-600/40">Vulnerable</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="text-red-200/90 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto text-[11px] space-y-1">
[GPS] GPSLatitude: 37° 46' 29.80" N
[GPS] GPSLongitude: 122° 25' 09.84" W
[GPS] GPSAltitude: 15.2 meters
[Device] Make: Apple
[Device] Model: iPhone 15 Pro Max
[Device] Serial: DN6L4980P0K5
[Lens] Model: 6.86mm f/1.78
[OS] Software: iOS 18.2 (22C152)
[Time] DateTimeOriginal: 2026:10:14 15:32:18
[Exposure] ISO: 64, Shutter: 1/120s, F: 1.8
[XMP] Photoshop History & Document IDs</pre>
      </div>

      <!-- CleanPhoto Sanitized -->
      <div class="rounded-xl bg-[#030102] p-4 border border-red-900/60 relative">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-gray-200 pb-2 mb-2 border-b border-red-950">
          <span class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 text-white">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-red-500"></span>
            After CleanPhoto Canvas Scrub (0 Leaks)
          </span>
          <span class="text-[10px] bg-red-950/80 text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-red-500/40">100% Vault Safe</span>
        </div>
        <pre class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto text-[11px] space-y-1">
[GPS] &lt;NONE DETECTED&gt; (Destroyed)
[GPS] &lt;NONE DETECTED&gt; (Destroyed)
[GPS] &lt;NONE DETECTED&gt; (Destroyed)
[Device] &lt;NONE DETECTED&gt; (Destroyed)
[Device] &lt;NONE DETECTED&gt; (Destroyed)
[Device] &lt;NONE DETECTED&gt; (Destroyed)
[Lens] &lt;NONE DETECTED&gt; (Destroyed)
[OS] &lt;NONE DETECTED&gt; (Destroyed)
[Time] &lt;NONE DETECTED&gt; (Destroyed)
[Exposure] Pure RGB Canvas Pixels Only
[XMP/IPTC] Zero Byte Payload</pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
